      "widgets_values": [
        "The left part of this picture is a close crop of the main character's face, the right part is the full picture. Identify the character, their facial expression and what they are doing.\nReply with ONE line of comma-separated Danbooru tags and nothing else, in this order:\n1. the character's Danbooru tag, with the series qualifier when Danbooru uses one, e.g. rem (re:zero)\n2. the series' Danbooru copyright tag\n3. facial expression tags\n4. tags for the pose and what they are doing\n5. visible hair, eye and outfit tags\nUse lowercase, spaces instead of underscores, and escape parentheses as \\( and \\). If the character is original or you cannot tell, start with: original, original",
