      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Anime Character Upscale\n\n1. Crops the face and asks **Grok** who the character is, their expression and what they are doing.\n2. Asks Grok for that character's **LoRA on Civitai**, checks the link (searching Civitai when it's wrong) and downloads it once.\n3. Upscales 2x with **tile ControlNet + IPAdapter + Ultimate SD Upscale**.\n4. Re-renders the face with **FaceDetailer** and the character LoRA.\n\n**Keys** (environment variables, never typed here): `XAI_API_KEY` for Grok, `CIVITAI_API_TOKEN` (or `CAI_API_KEY`) for Civitai.\n\n**One picture:** pick it in *Load Image* and queue.\n**A folder:** mute *Load Image* (Ctrl+M), unmute *Load Folder*, set its directory, queue once. Every picture gets its own character and LoRA.\n\nThe series hint is optional. When no character LoRA is found, Face Enhancer Illustrious is used instead.\nModels: set `DOWNLOAD_CHARACTER_UPSCALE=true` or run `/download_CharacterUpscale.sh`."
      ],
      "title": "How to use"
    }
